<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-SLAVIA DOWN MALMO 3-1 TO ADVANCE IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLAVIA DOWN MALMO 3-1 TO ADVANCE IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of UEFA Cup first round,</p>
<p>second leg matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Slavia Prague (Czech Republic) 3 Malmo FF (Sweden) 1 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Slavia Prague - Martin Penicka (13th), Robert Vagner</p>
<p>(29th), Pavel Horvath (69th penalty)</p>
<p>Malmo - Jens Fjellstrom (56th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,602</p>
<p>Slavia wins 5-2 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
